  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce cauliflower",
    "3 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "1/2 cup pork rinds",
    "45 gram green onion",
    "1 large egg",
    "3 ounce white cheddar cheese",
    "2 teaspoon psyllium husk powder",
    "3/4 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1/2 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/2 teaspoon dried tarragon",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400F. Measure out the cauliflower and chop into florets.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the florets to a plastic bag and then add the olive oil and salt. Shake well until the cauliflower is fully coated.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7211.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread the florets onto a baking sheet lined with foil and bake for 35 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the cauliflower is cooking, add the pork rinds to a food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7222.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process the rinds until they become a crumbly meal. Remove and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7231.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice up the green onions, crack an egg into a bowl and whisk it lightly, and shred the white cheddar. Measure out the psyllium husk powder, black pepper, red pepper flakes, dried tarragon, and garlic powder.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_72361.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once roasted, add the cauliflower to the food processor and pulse it a few times to help break it up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7247.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine all ingredients (except the pork rind crumbs) in a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7249.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix everything together well to form a sticky paste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7251.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the cauliflower mixture into patties and dredge these in the pork rind crumbs. Lay the patties on the same baking sheet used to roast the cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7261.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 25 minutes. Broil for an additional 2–3 minutes fot a crispier outside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/IMG_7264.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven, let cool slightly, and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-cauliflower-cakes/#wprm-recipe-51213-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
